    "owner's",
    "risk."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 4.1,
   "end": 6.65,
   "text": "The Supreme Court ruled in 2019:",
   "hl": [
    "Supreme",
    "Court"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 6.65,
   "end": 8.85,
   "text": "Once a hotel's valet takes your keys,",
